What the?! No! No! You can't!

00:22:58.720 --> 00:23:03.400
I, Kasuga Kyosuke... had just pulled off
a once-in-a-lifetime blunder.

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:05.430
And yet...

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:16.510
If a day like this ever comes again...

00:23:18.780 --> 00:23:21.750
...the one next to me will be...

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:02.530
I dream of casting a spell
that captures your heart...

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:10.100
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:25.450
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory.   I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:25.450 --> 00:24:38.060
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:38.060 --> 00:24:48.270
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:55.280
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:25:06.680
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:12.860 --> 00:25:16.090
It turns out that Ayukawa's parents
are internationally-famous musicians!

00:25:16.090 --> 00:25:17.360
"Ayukawas' Daughter marries."

00:25:17.360 --> 00:25:18.760
That was a surprise!
But what really surprised me was that...

00:25:18.760 --> 00:25:21.230
"Ayukawas To Seek Permanent Residency in America?"

00:25:21.230 --> 00:25:21.340
That was a surprise!
But what really surprised me was that...

00:25:21.340 --> 00:25:26.740
...the family, including Ayukawa, would be moving to America!

00:25:26.740 --> 00:25:30.540
Next time: "Study Abroad in America. Good-bye, Madoka!"
